#. ID 18, Page 1, Line 1, Pos (17,5)
msgid ""
"Attempt to change the graphic of invalid vehicles.\n"
"RPG_RT ignores those commands and will not\n"
"complain if the requested CharSet does not exist"
msgstr ""
"Tentative de changer l'apparence de véhicules\n"
"invalides. RPG_RT ignorera ces commandes et ne\n"
"se plaindra pas si le CharSet demandé n'existe\n"
"pas."

